<GuideLayout 
  title="Activewear Shipping & Logistics: Reducing Lead Times"
  type="LOGISTICS"
  description="Optimize your supply chain. Learn about air vs sea freight, DDP terms, and how to manage inventory for peak seasons."
>
  <p>Production is only half the battle. Getting your goods to market efficiently is crucial.</p>
  <h3>Air Freight vs Sea Freight</h3>
  <p>Air freight is fast (5-7 days) but expensive. Sea freight is cost-effective but takes 25-40 days. We recommend a hybrid strategy for new launches.</p>
  <h3>Understanding DDP Terms</h3>
  <p>Delivered Duty Paid (DDP) means we handle all customs and taxes, delivering the goods directly to your warehouse.</p>
  <h3>Peak Season Planning</h3>
  <p>Plan your Chinese New Year and Q4 holidays 3 months in advance to avoid container shortages and shipping delays.</p>
</GuideLayout>
